                                "sense_id": "802ad374-1ef9-3a7e-aea1-ab0aacc45cf4",
                                "text": "\"If I had been a man,\" she said, \"I should so like to have been called Allan!\"\n\"Call me by my name, if you really like it,\" he whispered persuasively. \"Call me 'Allan', for once - just to try.\""
